jobs.requirements:
- Experience and proficiency with corporate tax compliance with at least 4 years of aggregate experience, with a consultancy background being considered a plus;
- Advisory and compliance experience across direct taxes, both local and cross-border (as well as with tax treaties), including working knowledge of transfer pricing rules;
- Familiar with recent updates in tax topics that are relevant for corporate tax compliance (e.g., Pillars 1, 2 of the OECD Programme of Work, DSTs)
- Analytical skills and a high attention to detail
